# Architecture: JH-40515

## Status
DONE

## Problem Restatement
Màn hình import Step 1 của Jinji hiện đang hiển thị `人事設定` dưới dạng một dropdown detail phẳng, ví dụ `基本情報_出身地`, `所属_勤務地`, `給与計算_給与支給単価`. Yêu cầu hiện tại là đổi UI cho `メニュー選択 = 人事設定` thành 3 cấp giống reference:

1. top menu: `人事設定`
2. middle menu group: `基本情報`, `家族`, `学歴`, `給与計算`, `研修`, `採用`, `資格・免許`, `所属`, `職歴`
3. leaf menu detail: `出身地`, `雇用区分`, ... tương ứng group đã chọn

Contract backend không đổi: khi đi tiếp/import vẫn gửi `menu_selection=setting_hr` và `menu_detail=<leaf key>` như `basic_info_place_of_birth`, `payroll_payment_unit_cost`, `affiliation_work_location`. Middle group chỉ là state/UI grouping.

## Current Flow
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/controllers/Import.php::filter_menu_select_by_role()` build `$menu_selection` từ `MENU_SELECTION_IMPORT_*`, trong đó `setting_hr.detail` lấy từ `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT`.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/views/import/import_step_1.php` render:
  - `select[name="import[menu_selection]"]`
  - `select[name="import[menu_detail]"]`
  - `#js-midItems` hiện chủ yếu dùng cho `employee`.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/views/import/index.php` inject `var menu_selection = ...` cho JS.
- Active JS ở `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/assets/hr/js/import/import_index.js` đang generate `menu_detail` trực tiếp từ `menu_selection[setting_hr].detail`.
- `custom.js` cũng có hardcode flat `setting_hr` options, nhưng active import screen phụ thuộc chính vào `application/modules/common/assets/...`, không chỉ `assets/templates/...`.
- Core backend ở `jinjer_hr_core/application/controllers/v1/Import.php` và `MasterSettingImportRegistry.php` đã validate leaf `menu_detail`, allowed import type, CSV headers và route job theo leaf. Backend không biết và không cần biết middle group.
- Current code đang lệch nhau:
  - `MasterSettingImportRegistry` đã có nhiều leaf như `training_*`, `qualification_license_*`, `affiliation_*`, `payroll_*`.
  - Active `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT` trong `application/modules/common/config/constants.php` chưa đủ các leaf này.
  - `application/modules/common/config/fields.php`, `application/config/fields.php`, và helper list trong `Import.php` chưa đồng bộ toàn bộ master setting leaf, nên một số detail có nguy cơ không hiện đúng template/header fields.

## Proposed Flow
1. Khi user chọn `メニュー選択 = 人事設定`, JS build middle group dropdown từ một map cố định theo reference order.
2. Source leaf vẫn là `menu_selection.setting_hr.detail` đã được PHP role-filter. JS chỉ đưa leaf vào group nếu leaf key còn tồn tại trong source này.
3. Nếu group không còn leaf nào sau role filtering, không hiển thị group đó.
4. Khi user chọn middle group:
   - generate leaf dropdown từ các leaf còn allowed trong group
   - display label leaf không có prefix group, ví dụ `基本情報_出身地` hiển thị `出身地`
   - set `select[name="import[menu_detail]"]` value bằng leaf key backend hiện có
   - trigger logic hiện tại của `.menu_details.change()` để reset import type, template, required field, next-step state
5. Khi user chọn leaf:
   - existing `.menu_details.change()` tiếp tục xử lý template filtering, required fields, payroll update-only, accounting/payment special cases nếu còn nằm trong scope.
6. Với `給与計算`, dùng existing `PAYROLL_MASTER_SETTING_DETAILS` và `applyPayrollMasterSettingImportState()` để chỉ cho phép `更新`.
7. Backend core giữ nguyên contract và validation. UI grouping không thay thế backend validation.

## Impacted Repos/Modules
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/views/import/import_step_1.php` — chuẩn bị/reuse middle select cho `setting_hr` group, không chỉ employee.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/assets/hr/js/import/import_index.js` — thêm group map, build/reset middle + leaf dropdown, giữ payroll update-only và required-field logic.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/assets/hr/js/import/custom.js` — đồng bộ logic/options nếu file này còn được load ở template/import-related screen.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/assets/templates/hr/js/import/import_index.js` — đồng bộ template asset để tránh lệch source/tracked asset.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/assets/templates/hr/js/import/custom.js` — đồng bộ template asset tương ứng.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/config/constants.php` — bổ sung `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT` cho toàn bộ leaf backend đang support trong JH-40515.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/config/fields.php` — đồng bộ field label theo leaf để Step 3/template field list chỉ hiện đúng menu detail đã chọn.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/config/fields.php` — đồng bộ duplicate/common config path đang tồn tại trong repo.
- `jinjer_hr_jinji/application/modules/common/controllers/Import.php` — mở rộng các list helper `BASIC_INFO_MASTER_SETTING_IMPORT_DETAILS` hoặc tách list rõ hơn cho common master setting, affiliation option, payroll để `setting_fields()` trả đúng fields theo leaf.
- `jinjer_hr_core/application/services/MasterSettingImport/Support/MasterSettingImportRegistry.php` — không cần đổi cho UI grouping; chỉ dùng làm source-of-truth backend khi kiểm tra leaf nào thực sự import được.

## Design Decisions
1. Decision: Middle group là frontend-only state.
   - Reason: Backend import APIs và jobs đang validate/routing theo `menu_detail` leaf; đổi payload sẽ tăng blast radius không cần thiết.
   - Alternatives considered: gửi thêm `menu_group` lên backend. Không chọn vì backend không cần group và sẽ phải chỉnh nhiều API/history/template path.

2. Decision: Build group options từ PHP role-filtered `menu_selection.setting_hr.detail`, không từ hardcode độc lập.
   - Reason: role filtering hiện nằm trong `filter_menu_select_by_role()`. Nếu JS tự list toàn bộ leaf sẽ lộ menu user không có quyền.
   - Alternatives considered: hardcode toàn bộ group/leaf ở JS rồi filter sau bằng permission riêng. Không chọn vì duplicate permission logic.

3. Decision: Dùng explicit `MASTER_SETTING_MENU_GROUPS` map ở JS để giữ order và label đúng reference.
   - Reason: label hiện tại dùng dạng `基本情報_出身地`; tự split bằng `_` không xử lý tốt `家族 -> 続柄`, `資格・免許`, hoặc legacy labels.
   - Alternatives considered: parse prefix từ label. Không chọn vì dễ sai với label không cùng group name.

4. Decision: Chỉ hiển thị leaf đã được backend import support và PHP constants expose; không thêm `所属 > 役職` trong scope hiện tại.
   - Reason: prior context đã quyết định exclude `affiliation_job_title`; `MasterSettingImportRegistry` hiện không có `affiliation_job_title`.
   - Alternatives considered: thêm UI `役職` trước. Không chọn vì user có thể chọn menu mà backend reject.

5. Decision: Đồng bộ active asset path trước, template asset path sau.
   - Reason: verifier trước đó đã chỉ ra lỗi sửa `assets/templates/...` nhưng màn import đang chạy dùng `application/modules/common/assets/...`.
   - Alternatives considered: chỉ sửa một path. Không chọn vì repo đang duy trì duplicate assets/config và dễ tái phát lệch môi trường.

## Implementation Approach
1. Define group map in active `import_index.js`, preserving reference order:
   - `基本情報`: `basic_info_place_of_birth`, `basic_info_employment_classification`, `basic_info_permission_to_transfer`, `basic_info_going_division`, `basic_info_retirement_classification`, `basic_info_retirement_reason`, `basic_info_residential_area`
   - `家族`: `family_family`
   - `学歴`: `education_graduation_classification`, `education_education_classification`, `education_public_and_private_classification`, `education_classification_of_literature`
   - `給与計算`: `payroll_payment_unit_cost`, `payroll_deduction_unit_price`, `payroll_time_unit_price`, `payroll_bonus_deduction`
   - `研修`: `training_training_classification`, `training_organizer`, `training_name_of_training`, `training_completion_category`, `training_achievement`
   - `採用`: `adopt_recruiting_classification`, `adopt_hiring_place`, `adopt_hiring_route`
   - `資格・免許`: `qualification_license_qualification_classification`
   - `所属`: `affiliation_change_category`, `affiliation_work_location`, `affiliation_job_category`, `affiliation_duties`, `affiliation_option_one`, `affiliation_option_two`, `affiliation_option_three`
   - `職歴`: `experience_industry`
2. Add helper functions:
   - `buildAllowedMasterSettingGroups(details)`
   - `generateMasterSettingGroupOptions(groups, $midSelect)`
   - `generateMasterSettingLeafOptions(groupKey, groups, $detailSelect)`
   - `getLeafDisplayLabel(groupLabel, fullLabel, explicitLeafLabel)`
3. In `init_menu_detail()` and `.menu_selection.change()`:
   - for `setting_hr`, show `#js-midItems` as group dropdown
   - populate group dropdown from allowed groups
   - populate leaf dropdown for first/current group
   - trigger `.menu_details.change()` after leaf dropdown is ready
4. Add a `#js-selectMidItems.change()` handler:
   - if current top menu is `employee`, preserve existing resident-tax behavior
   - if current top menu is `setting_hr`, regenerate leaf detail and trigger `.menu_details.change()`
5. Reset behavior:
   - changing top menu hides/clears setting_hr group state when not `setting_hr`
   - changing middle group resets template selection, file/header selection state through existing `.menu_details.change()` path
6. Sync PHP constants and field config:
   - add missing leaf labels to `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT`
   - add matching `$config['setting_hr']` entries for all supported leaf labels/keys in both active common config paths
   - add `required_fields['affiliation_option_master_setting']` where missing
7. Update `Import.php::setting_fields()` helper lists so Step 3/template preview uses the selected leaf columns for:
   - common 3-column master settings
   - `basic_info_employment_classification`
   - `family_family`
   - `adopt_recruiting_classification`
   - `affiliation_work_location`
   - `affiliation_option_one/two/three`
   - payroll details
8. Keep core backend unchanged unless implementation discovers a leaf exposed in UI is absent from `MasterSettingImportRegistry`; in that case either remove it from UI group map or add backend schema only with explicit ticket approval.

## Test Strategy
- Unit/static checks:
  - PHP lint for changed PHP files:
    - `php -l application/modules/common/config/constants.php`
    - `php -l application/modules/common/config/fields.php`
    - `php -l application/config/fields.php`
    - `php -l application/modules/common/controllers/Import.php`
  - JS syntax check for changed JS if Node is available:
    - `node --check application/modules/common/assets/hr/js/import/import_index.js`
    - `node --check application/modules/common/assets/hr/js/import/custom.js`
    - same for `assets/templates/...`
- Static behavior assertions with script/grep:
  - every leaf in `MASTER_SETTING_MENU_GROUPS` exists in `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT`
  - every UI-exposed import leaf exists in `MasterSettingImportRegistry::SCHEMAS`, except legacy non-master details intentionally excluded
  - payroll leaf list remains equal to `PAYROLL_MASTER_SETTING_DETAILS`
  - active asset path and template asset path both contain new grouping helpers
- Existing backend tests:
  - run focused MasterSettingCsv/Import tests in Docker if environment is available.
- Manual QA scenarios:
  - Do not use Browser/manual QA on Jinji per repo rule.
  - Describe expected screen scenarios for human/staging QA only:
    - select `人事設定` shows 9 group labels in reference order
    - select `基本情報` shows 7 leaf labels without `基本情報_` prefix
    - select `給与計算` shows 4 leaf labels and only `更新`
    - select `所属` shows supported leafs; `役職` remains absent unless backend support is added
    - submit path still sends leaf `menu_detail`

## Risks & Mitigations
- Risk: UI exposes a leaf not supported by backend.
  - Mitigation: build a static assertion comparing group map against `MasterSettingImportRegistry::SCHEMAS`; do not expose `affiliation_job_title` in this scope.
- Risk: role filtering bypassed by frontend hardcode.
  - Mitigation: group builder must intersect explicit group map with `menu_selection.setting_hr.detail` from PHP.
- Risk: duplicate asset/config paths drift again.
  - Mitigation: update active `application/modules/common/...` first and mirror `assets/templates/...`; add static check for both paths.
- Risk: legacy `setting_hr` details like `attandance_group`, `payment_destination`, `accounting_dept` are mixed into master setting groups incorrectly.
  - Mitigation: grouped master UI should include only reference master-setting groups. If product still needs legacy details under the same top menu, add a separate explicit legacy group after confirmation, not by prefix parsing.
- Risk: `#js-midItems` is already used by employee resident-tax flow.
  - Mitigation: gate handler by current `menu_selection`; preserve employee branch and add setting_hr branch separately.
- Risk: template/header Step 3 shows all setting_hr columns instead of selected leaf.
  - Mitigation: update `Import.php::setting_fields()` helper lists and config entries together with UI changes.

## Rollback Plan
Revert Jinji UI/config changes only:

1. Restore `import_step_1.php`, active/template `import_index.js`, and active/template `custom.js` to previous flat `menu_detail` behavior.
2. Restore `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT`, `fields.php`, and `Import.php` helper-list changes if they were only needed by grouped UI.
3. Do not revert `jinjer_hr_core` import registry/tests unless implementation added new backend schemas in a later step.
4. After rollback, verify `人事設定` returns to flat dropdown and core backend MasterSettingImport tests still pass.

